  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n請容我商量一件事。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A8ACB5BB96211554691CF4E004EF64E8B3002001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "說起來這是件私事，\n但我和女兒說好了要在她的生日<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n送給她某種寶可夢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8AAA8D774F869019662F4EF679C14E8BFF0C000A4F466211548C597351528AAA597D4E868981572859797684751F65E500100001BE00000A90017D66597967D07A2E5BF653EF59223002001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "她的生日禮物\n將會是一隻<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>謎擬Ｑ<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "59797684751F65E579AE7269000A5C076703662F4E0096BB00100002FF0000068B0E64ECFF3100100002FF0000003002001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "由於謎擬Ｑ是夜行性的，\n對年幼的孩子來說，照顧起來難度很高。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我也表達過自己覺得為之過早。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "753165BC8B0E64ECFF31662F591C884C60277684FF0C000A5C0D5E745E7C76845B695B504F868AAAFF0C716798678D774F8696E35EA65F889AD8300200100001BE00000A62114E5F88689054904E81EA5DF189BA5F9770BA4E4B904E65E93002001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但若不送給我女兒一隻謎擬Ｑ，\n我就必須把髮飾還給她。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F4682E54E0D90017D666211597351524E0096BB8B0E64ECFF31FF0C000A62115C315FC59808628A9AEE98FE90847D6659793002001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "沒錯，這個髮飾\n是她送給我的禮物。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n據說是使用咩利羊體毛的\n毛氈製作的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6C92932FFF0C9019500B9AEE98FE000A662F597990017D666211768479AE7269300200100001BE01000A64DA8AAA662F4F7F752854A952297F8A9AD46BDB7684000A6BDB6C0888FD4F5C76843002001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這已經是構成我這個人的要素之一，\n沒辦法還給女兒了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90195DF27D93662F69CB621062119019500B4EBA768489817D204E4B4E00FF0C000A6C928FA66CD590847D66597351524E863002001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "雖然卡洛斯地區\n沒有謎擬Ｑ，但……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n若是在異次元密阿雷裡面，\n說不定就能遇見牠。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96D6713653616D1B65AF57305340000A6C9267098B0E64ECFF31FF0C4F462026202600100001BE01000A82E5662F572875706B2151435BC6963F96F788E19762FF0C000A8AAA4E0D5B9A5C3180FD9047898B72603002001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳遇上謎擬Ｑ時，\n願意捕捉一隻給我，我會感激不盡的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C00100003110000FF01014F6059B390474E0A8B0E64ECFF316642FF0C000A9858610F635563494E0096BB7D666211FF0C62116703611F6FC04E0D76E176843002001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳願意把謎擬Ｑ讓給我嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B39858610F628A8B0E64ECFF318B937D66621155CEFF1F001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "甘心樂意！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75185FC36A02610FFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請等一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB7B494E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "很抱歉這完全是件私事，\n但請務必將謎擬Ｑ讓給我！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F8862B16B4990195B8C5168662F4EF679C14E8BFF0C000A4F468ACB52D95FC55C078B0E64ECFF318B937D666211FF01001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請收下我由衷的感謝。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB65364E0B6211753188777684611F8B1D3002001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "謎擬Ｑ還擁有妖精屬性，\n能藉此剋制龍屬性。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8B0E64ECFF31908464C1670959967CBE5C6C6027FF0C000A80FD85C96B64524B52369F8D5C6C60273002001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "也許將來某天我女兒會成為訓練家，\n並且打敗我的老翁龍。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E5F8A315C074F8667D059296211597351526703621070BA8A137DF45BB6FF0C000A4E264E14625365576211768480017FC19F8D3002001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "屆時要如何去應對這件事，\n就要看我這個當父親的能耐囉！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C466642898159824F5553BB61C95C0D90194EF64E8BFF0C000A5C318981770B62119019500B7576723689AA768480FD801056C9FF01001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，包含這次的事情在內，\n謝謝<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳總是不吝幫忙！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C5305542B90196B2176844E8B60C557285167FF0C000A8B1D8B1D00100003110000FF01014F6059B37E3D662F4E0D541D5E6B5FD9FF01001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    }
